      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe CUDA `diffusion` extra in `python/pyproject.toml` lists `websockets`. `diffusion_common` in `python/pyproject_other.toml` does not. That block is the base for `diffusion_hip` (installed by the ROCm Docker image and, through `all_hip`, by the AMD CI), and for `diffusion_musa` and `diffusion_mps`.\n\nWithout `websockets` or `wsproto`, uvicorn cannot accept a WebSocket upgrade, so the realtime video API is unreachable on ROCm installs:\n\n- **The shipped image.** `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:v0.5.21-rocm10-mi35x-20261014` (SGLang `bab9c81`) has neither package. On it, a `robbyant/lingbot-world-fast-diffusers` server with `--pipeline-class-name LingBotWorldCausalDMDPipeline` reports healthy on 1× MI355X, but an upgrade request to `/v1/realtime_video/generate` gets `404 Not Found`, and uvicorn logs `No supported WebSocket library detected. Please use \"pip install 'uvicorn[standard]'\", or install 'websockets' or 'wsproto' manually.`\n- **The AMD CI.** It hits the same gap from the client side. `lingbot_world_realtime_plastic_beach` is skipped on every `multimodal-gen-test-1-gpu-amd` run (for example scheduled run 38661136204, partition 3) at the `websockets` import guard in `test/server/realtime_consistency.py`, so the realtime path never runs on AMD.\n\n## Modifications\n\nAdd `websockets` to `diffusion_common`, unpinned as in the CUDA extra.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nSame image and server on 1× MI355X (gfx950), with `websockets` 17.2 installed:\n\n- The upgrade request returns `101 Switching Protocols`.\n- `pytest sglang/multimodal_gen/test/server/test_server_1_gpu.py -k lingbot_world_realtime_plastic_beach` gives 1 passed in 95.7 s.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo kernel or model change. Chunk timings from that run (832×480, warmup off):\n\n- The first chunk takes 27.4 s, which includes the first-call compile.\n- The next three take 1.75–1.89 s per 12-frame chunk.\n\ncc @HaiShaw @michaelzhang-ai, since this also lets the AMD lane run the realtime LingBot-World case instead of skipping it.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38775243570](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38775243570)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38775243383](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38775243383)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38775243380](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38775243380)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
